---
---  ★ 阶段链（各子程序的 `ins_130 SET_DEATH_CALLBACK` / `ins_133 SET_LIFE_CALLBACK` /
---    `ins_134 SET_TIMER_CALLBACK`）：Sub61（162 火鼠の皮衣）`DEATH->38` →
